{title: How Great Is Our God}
{song_number: 152}
{language: en}

{comment: Verse 1}
The [G]splendor of the King, [Em7]clothed in majesty;
let all the earth rejoice, [C]all the earth rejoice.
He [G]wraps Himself in light, and [Em7]darkness tries to hide,
and trembles at His voice, [C]and trembles at His voice.

{comment: Chorus}
How [G]great is our God! Sing with me: How [Em7]great is our God!
And all will see how [Cmaj7]great, how [D]great is our [G]God!

{comment: Verse 2}
And [G]age to age He stands, and [Em7]time is in His hands;
beginning and the end, [C]beginning and the end.
The [G]Godhead, three in one, [Em7]Father, Spirit, Son;
the Lion and the Lamb, [C]the Lion and the Lamb.

{comment: Bridge}
[G]Name above all names, [Em7]worthy of all praise;
my [Cmaj7]heart will sing: How great [D]is our [G]God!
